        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant Plots</strong> is a relaxing puzzle board game in which you are given an isometric grid of tiles and a set of plants per level. In order to win you have to plant all the given plants, but all of them have different effects over the others! So it is no easy task. Plant Plots a cozy experience to dive in and relax while solving pretty looking puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plants placing:</strong> Place plants on the maps in order to win the level. Be careful though, you might destroy some already planted ones if you are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/87872db7d38088699a96324bf05df939.poster.avif?t=1762398170\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/87872db7d38088699a96324bf05df939.webm?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/87872db7d38088699a96324bf05df939.mp4?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoveling plants:</strong> If you planted a plant in a place you don't like, you can remove it with the shovel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a591bf9b169608d7a3f4d93eeb8eb621.poster.avif?t=1762398170\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a591bf9b169608d7a3f4d93eeb8eb621.webm?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a591bf9b169608d7a3f4d93eeb8eb621.mp4?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cheat Sheet:</strong> If you do not remember what plants have effects over what other plants, you can always use the in-game cheat sheet to remind yourself about it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a6b70b760e44203cf604ec1c03dc6dcd.poster.avif?t=1762398170\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a6b70b760e44203cf604ec1c03dc6dcd.webm?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a6b70b760e44203cf604ec1c03dc6dcd.mp4?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Static Plants:</strong> Some levels already start with highlighted plants called &quot;Static Plants&quot;. They cannot be destroyed, so you have to accommodate your game-play according to the level layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/e92ef522954f8ca0e7883ccc55168c6a.poster.avif?t=1762398170\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/e92ef522954f8ca0e7883ccc55168c6a.webm?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/e92ef522954f8ca0e7883ccc55168c6a.mp4?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant Plots</strong> is a relaxing puzzle board game in which you are given an isometric grid of tiles and a set of plants per level. In order to win you have to plant all the given plants, but all of them have different effects over the others! So it is no easy task. Plant Plots a cozy experience to dive in and relax while solving pretty looking puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plants placing:</strong> Place plants on the maps in order to win the level. Be careful though, you might destroy some already planted ones if you are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/87872db7d38088699a96324bf05df939.poster.avif?t=1762398170\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/87872db7d38088699a96324bf05df939.webm?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/87872db7d38088699a96324bf05df939.mp4?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoveling plants:</strong> If you planted a plant in a place you don't like, you can remove it with the shovel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a591bf9b169608d7a3f4d93eeb8eb621.poster.avif?t=1762398170\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a591bf9b169608d7a3f4d93eeb8eb621.webm?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a591bf9b169608d7a3f4d93eeb8eb621.mp4?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cheat Sheet:</strong> If you do not remember what plants have effects over what other plants, you can always use the in-game cheat sheet to remind yourself about it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a6b70b760e44203cf604ec1c03dc6dcd.poster.avif?t=1762398170\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a6b70b760e44203cf604ec1c03dc6dcd.webm?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/a6b70b760e44203cf604ec1c03dc6dcd.mp4?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Static Plants:</strong> Some levels already start with highlighted plants called &quot;Static Plants&quot;. They cannot be destroyed, so you have to accommodate your game-play according to the level layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/e92ef522954f8ca0e7883ccc55168c6a.poster.avif?t=1762398170\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/e92ef522954f8ca0e7883ccc55168c6a.webm?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857190/extras/e92ef522954f8ca0e7883ccc55168c6a.mp4?t=1762398170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Plant Plots is a relaxing puzzle board game where you'll need to be a clever gardener to make it through a variety of tricky levels. But watch out, these plants don't behave quite like the ones you're used to. Dive in and unwind as you solve beautifully crafted puzzles.",
